---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About & Education — Cain Macias" description="Explore Cain Macias’s background, degrees in computer science, business analytics and healthcare administration, and professional certifications."><header class="ref-page-intro ref-reveal">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">About Me</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
      I work across software engineering, business systems, and business analysis in Corpus Christi, Texas. My work centers on bridging complex legacy enterprise architectures with modern automation, data pipelines, and intelligent agents.
    </p>
    <a class="about-linkedin" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/cain-macias-a69801306/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Connect on LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </header>

  <div class="ref-about-content">
    <section class="ref-about-timeline ref-reveal" aria-labelledby="timeline-title">
      <div class="ref-section-label"><span class="ref-label-line"></span> TIMELINE <span class="ref-label-right">WORK & EDUCATION</span></div>
      <h2 id="timeline-title">where I've been</h2>
      <ol class="ref-timeline-list">
        <li>
          <div class="ref-timeline-dot ref-timeline-dot-mint"></div>
          <div class="ref-timeline-entry"><div class="ref-timeline-title"><strong>Jean's Restaurant Supply (Tari, Inc.)</strong><span>2025 — Now</span></div><p>Software Engineer · Enterprise systems, automation, and integration engineering</p></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="ref-timeline-dot ref-timeline-dot-blue"></div>
          <div class="ref-timeline-entry"><div class="ref-timeline-title"><strong>CHRISTUS Health</strong><span>2023 — 2025</span></div><p>Medical Laboratory Technician II · Data quality, precision, and clinical workflows</p></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="ref-timeline-dot ref-timeline-dot-gold"></div>
          <div class="ref-timeline-entry"><div class="ref-timeline-title"><strong>Schlitterbahn</strong><span>2018 — 2022</span></div><p>Warehouse Operations Supervisor · Inventory, reporting, and process improvements</p></div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">The Journey</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        As a first-generation college graduate and the oldest of four, my path into technology wasn't linear. Growing up, I didn't have a roadmap or easy access to technical mentors. After facing the loss of my Father right before my 15th birthday, I had to learn how to navigate academic hurdles—moving through aviation mechanics, pre-med biology, and remedial coursework before discovering my footing in Medical Laboratory Technology.
      </p>
      <p>
        Working as a Medical Lab Technician at Christus Health taught me the absolute value of precision, data integrity, and root-cause analysis. It was also where a mentor recognized my potential to look beyond individual testing errors and understand how entire operational systems function.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Transitioning to Systems & Software</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Technology has been a lifelong curiosity whether building custom home servers, experimenting with Linux distributions, or modding games. When I realized that software and automation offered an even larger canvas for root cause analysis and systemic problem solving, I dove in headfirst. As an early adopter of AI tooling starting in 2023, I began engineering pipelines that turned manual bottlenecks into autonomous workflows.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today, my goal is simple: to build resilient systems, bring tangible innovations to enterprise operations, and serve as a reliable mentor and example for my siblings and anyone else trying to navigate their way forward without a pre-written guide.
      </p>
    </section>


    <section class="journey-gallery ref-reveal" aria-labelledby="journey-gallery-title">
      <div class="ref-section-label"><span class="ref-label-line"></span> PERSONAL JOURNEY <span class="ref-label-right">THEN & NOW</span></div>
      <h2 id="journey-gallery-title">the moments behind the work</h2>
      <p class="journey-gallery-intro">A few snapshots of where I started, the people who shaped me, and the milestones that brought me here.</p>
      <div class="journey-photo-grid">
        <figure class="journey-photo journey-photo--childhood"><img src="/journey/childhood-sesame.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Childhood studio portrait wearing a blue Sesame Street outfit" /><figcaption><strong>The early years</strong><span>Where it all began</span></figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="journey-photo journey-photo--childhood"><img src="/journey/childhood-astros.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Childhood school portrait wearing an Astros jersey" /><figcaption><strong>Growing up</strong><span>A little piece of home</span></figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="journey-photo"><img src="/journey/del-mar-laboratory-milestone.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Receiving recognition in a laboratory coat at Del Mar College" /><figcaption><strong>A milestone in healthcare</strong><span>Medical Laboratory Technology · 2024</span></figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="journey-photo"><img src="/journey/graduation-family-tribute.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Wearing graduation regalia while honoring family at a graveside memorial" /><figcaption><strong>Carrying them with me</strong><span>Graduation, remembrance, and gratitude</span></figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="journey-photo journey-photo--detail"><img src="/journey/medical-lab-pin.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Medical Laboratory Technician pin on a white laboratory coat" /><figcaption><strong>The details matter</strong><span>A reminder of where my career began</span></figcaption></figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-education" aria-labelledby="education-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">ACADEMIC BACKGROUND</p>
          <h2 id="education-title">Education</h2>
        </div>
        <span class="section-index">04 DEGREES / PROGRAMS</span>
      </div>
      <p class="about-education-intro">My academic background spans computer science, business analytics, leadership, and clinical laboratory technology.</p>
      <ol class="education-list">
        <li class="education-card">
          <span class="education-number">01</span>
          <div class="education-info">
            <span class="education-school">Texas A&amp;M University–Corpus Christi</span>
            <h3>Master of Science (MS), Computer Science</h3>
            <span class="education-description">Graduate program in progress</span>
          </div>
          <span class="education-status">IN PROGRESS</span>
        </li>
        <li class="education-card">
          <span class="education-number">02</span>
          <div class="education-info">
            <span class="education-school">Texas A&amp;M University–Corpus Christi</span>
            <h3>Master of Business Administration (MBA)</h3>
            <p class="education-description">Business Analytics &amp; Healthcare Administration</p>
            <span class="education-gpa">GPA 4.0</span>
          </div>
          <span class="education-status">EXPECTED 2027</span>
        </li>
        <li class="education-card">
          <span class="education-number">03</span>
          <div class="education-info">
            <span class="education-school">Del Mar College</span>
            <h3>Bachelor of Applied Science (BAS)</h3>
            <p class="education-description">Management &amp; Leadership</p>
            <span class="education-honors">Dean’s List · President’s List</span>
          </div>
          <span class="education-status">2025</span>
        </li>
        <li class="education-card">
          <span class="education-number">04</span>
          <div class="education-info">
            <span class="education-school">Del Mar College</span>
            <h3>Associate of Applied Science (AAS)</h3>
            <p class="education-description">Medical Laboratory Technology</p>
          </div>
          <span class="education-status">2024</span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="about-certifications ref-reveal" aria-labelledby="certifications-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">VERIFIED LEARNING &amp; PROFESSIONAL DEVELOPMENT</p>
          <h2 id="certifications-title">Credentials &amp; certifications</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="credentials-intro">Hands-on AI engineering credentials alongside professional certificates in business analysis and project management.</p>
      <ul class="certification-list">
        <li class="certification-featured">
          <span class="certification-icon" aria-hidden="true">M</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Microsoft Applied Skills: Integrate model context protocol tools with agents in Microsoft Foundry</strong>
            <span>Microsoft · Earned November 20, 2026 · Applied Skills credential demonstrating model deployment, agent configuration, MCP tool integration, and usage monitoring.</span>
            <a class="credential-details-link" href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/credentials/applied-skills/integrate-model-context-protocol-tools-with-agents-in-microsoft-foundry/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">About this Microsoft credential ↗</a>
          </div>
          <span class="certification-date">NOV 2026</span>
        </li>
        <li class="certification-featured">
          <span class="certification-icon" aria-hidden="true">AMD</span>
          <div>
            <strong>AMD ROCm Certified Associate</strong>
            <span>AMD · 2026 · Earned after training and assessment in GPU architecture, ROCm, HIP, AI frameworks, and performance optimization.</span>
          </div>
          <span class="certification-date">2026</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="certification-icon" aria-hidden="true">IBM</span>
          <div>
            <strong>IBM Business Analyst Professional Certificate</strong>
            <span>IBM · Professional certificate in business analysis</span>
          </div>
          <span class="certification-date">2025</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="certification-icon" aria-hidden="true">G</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Google Project Management Certificate</strong>
            <span>Google · Professional certificate in project management</span>
          </div>
          <span class="certification-date">2025</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div></Layout>


<style>
  .journey-gallery { margin: 42px 0 56px; }
  .journey-gallery h2 { color: var(--text); font-size: clamp(23px, 3vw, 30px); font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -.045em; margin: 17px 0 8px; }
  .journey-gallery-intro { color: var(--muted); max-width: 640px; margin: 0 0 23px; }
  .journey-photo-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
  .journey-photo { grid-column: span 2; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--panel); }
  .journey-photo--childhood { grid-column: span 3; }
  .journey-photo img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 220px; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 35%; }
  .journey-photo--childhood img { height: 250px; }
  .journey-photo--detail img { object-position: center 48%; }
  .journey-photo figcaption { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; padding: 12px 14px 14px; }
  .journey-photo figcaption strong { color: var(--text); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 650; }
  .journey-photo figcaption span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; }
  @media(max-width: 640px) {
    .journey-photo-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 10px; }
    .journey-photo, .journey-photo--childhood { grid-column: span 1; }
    .journey-photo img, .journey-photo--childhood img { height: 190px; }
    .journey-photo:last-child { grid-column: span 2; }
    .journey-photo:last-child img { height: 160px; }
    .journey-photo figcaption { padding: 9px 10px 11px; }
  }

  .credentials-intro{margin:0 0 18px;max-width:760px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.75}
  .about-certifications .certification-list li{align-items:flex-start;padding:18px 12px;gap:14px}
  .about-certifications .certification-list li.certification-featured{background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(77,121,61,.12),transparent 80%);border-color:var(--line)}
  .about-certifications .certification-icon{flex:0 0 38px;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:4px;font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--blue);border-color:var(--line)}
  .about-certifications .certification-list strong{color:var(--text);font-size:14px;font-weight:650}
  .about-certifications .certification-date{flex:0 0 auto;white-space:nowrap;font-size:10px;padding-top:4px}
  .about-certifications .credential-details-link{display:inline-flex;align-self:flex-start;margin-top:6px;color:var(--blue);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
  .about-certifications .credential-details-link:hover{color:var(--text)}
  @media(max-width:560px){
    .about-certifications .certification-list li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px minmax(0,1fr);gap:6px 13px;padding:17px 8px}
    .about-certifications .certification-date{grid-column:2;padding-top:0;font-size:9px}
  }
</style>
